# 低频词汇 List02 短语

## 常考短语

- **do justice to**: 公平对待。例：The film does justice to the novel.
- **draw a conclusion**: 得出结论。例：We can draw a conclusion from the data.
- **fall back on**: 求助于。例：She fell back on her savings.
- **get the hang of**: 掌握。例：I finally got the hang of it.
- **give sb. the benefit of the doubt**: 假定某人无辜。例：Give him the benefit of the doubt.
- **go to great lengths**: 竭尽全力。例：She went to great lengths to help.
- **have a bearing on**: 与…有关。例：This has a bearing on our decision.
- **hold good**: 有效。例：The rule still holds good.
- **in conjunction with**: 与…一起。例：Use it in conjunction with other tools.
- **in proportion to**: 与…成比例。例：Salary is in proportion to experience.
- **lay off**: 裁员。例：The factory laid off 200 workers.
- **leave much to be desired**: 有很多不足。例：Service leaves much to be desired.
- **live up to**: 达到；不辜负。例：He lived up to expectations.
- **make up for**: 弥补。例：Hard work makes up for lack of talent.
- **on the verge of**: 在…边缘。例：She was on the verge of tears.
